  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adeso/NEAR Localization Start-Up Workshop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD has entered a partnering agreement with Adeso for supporting the founding of a southern-based pooled funding mechanism.  Inherent in these efforts are capacity building activities in five pilot countries -- DRC, South Sudan, Turkey, Nepal, and Somalia.  The fundamental, primary activities of capacity strengthening and research will be accomplished under a grant from ECHO (as documented in ICD 845).  This project supports a kick-off workshop not eligible for funding under the ECHO grant which occurred on  06 - 14 July 2016.</narrative>
  </description>
